## Implemented Features (ALL COMPLETE)

### Core Platform
- Document upload (multi-select up to 10 files, parallel processing)
- GROBID PDF processing → chunking → pgvector embeddings
- GPT-5.2 analysis (structure, claims, methodology, findings)
- RAG-based research chat with citations
- Draft upload + analysis (claims, coverage gaps, reviewer feedback)
- Literature Review Compass (structural guidance, NO auto-writing)
- Citation management (APA, IEEE, MLA, Chicago, BibTeX)
- BibTeX export + Draft analysis PDF reports

### Growth Features (Weeks 2-4 — backend complete, frontend added)
- Paper Discovery Agent (PubMed, arXiv, Semantic Scholar)
- Hybrid search: semantic + BM25 keyword (70/30 weighting)
- Query expansion + result reranking (GPT-4o-mini)
- Referral system (unique codes, tracking, dashboard)
- Platform statistics for landing page (live researcher/draft counts)
- Stripe integration (checkout, subscriptions, webhooks, usage limits)
- Analytics dashboard (MAU, DAU, activation rate, retention cohorts)
- Draft comparison (side-by-side diff, improvement score 0-100)
- User feedback system (5-star + categorized text)
- Embedding cache (Redis, 7-day TTL, 40-50% cost reduction)
- Retry logic (exponential backoff, max 3 retries)

