## Design System (Quick Reference)

**Full details in `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` and `services/frontend/tailwind.config.js`**

### Colors
```
Page bg:    bg-bg-void (#0F0F14)
Card bg:    bg-bg-surface (#18181F)
Modal bg:   bg-bg-elevated (#1E1E27)
Hover:      bg-bg-hover (#252530)

Headline:   text-text-primary (#EDEDEF)
Body:       text-text-secondary (#B4B4B8)
Label:      text-text-tertiary (#6E6E77)
Meta:       text-text-muted (#43434A)

CTA/Focus:  accent-primary (#E5484D), accent-hover (#F2555A)
Analysis:   teal-primary (#0D9488)
Drafts:     indigo-primary (#6366F1)
Warnings:   amber-primary (#F59E0B)

Border:     border-border-default (rgba(255,255,255,0.08))
```

### Component Patterns
```tsx
// Card
<div className="bg-bg-surface border border-border-default rounded-lg p-6 shadow-xs hover:border-border-strong hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-fast">

// Primary button
<button className="bg-accent-primary hover:bg-accent-hover text-white rounded-md px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-fast">

// Input
<input className="bg-bg-surface border border-border-default rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm text-text-primary placeholder:text-text-muted focus:border-accent-primary focus:ring-1 focus:ring-accent-primary transition-colors duration-fast w-full" />

// Badge
<span className="bg-teal-light text-teal-primary text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">
```

### Rules
- Max border radius: `rounded-xl` (12px). NEVER `rounded-2xl` or `rounded-3xl`
- Font weight for headings: `font-semibold`. NEVER `font-bold` on dark backgrounds
- Transitions: always `duration-fast` (150ms)
- Shadows: realistic dark shadows only. NO colored glows except `shadow-focus`
- Hover lift: max `-translate-y-0.5` (2px). Never more

