## Common Issues & Debugging

### Containers
```bash
# Rebuild everything
cd infra && docker-compose down && docker-compose up --build

# Watch analysis tasks
docker logs -f noesis-celery-worker

# Backend API (Swagger)
open http://localhost:8000/docs

# Frontend
open http://localhost:5173

# GROBID health
curl http://localhost:8070/api/isalive
```

### Document Upload Issues
- Documents stuck in "ready": auto-trigger in `rag_ingest.py` should fix this
- Analysis failing with 400: check for `max_tokens` vs `max_completion_tokens` (GPT-5.2)
- Rate limit errors: OpenAI free tier = 3 req/min. Retry logic (60s backoff) handles this
- Parallel uploads failing: upgrade OpenAI to Tier 1 ($5/mo, 500 req/min)

### Database
- All operations via `supabase.table()` — no direct SQL in app code
- Embeddings: 1536 dimensions (text-embedding-3-small)
- JSONB columns for structured metadata (GIN indexes)
- Migrations in `infra/db-migrations/` — run manually in Supabase SQL editor

